    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Be the Dragon. Rule the World.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dragon Realms, you take control of a powerful dragon on a mission to dominate a vast fantasy world. Fly across sprawling lands, destroy villages, castles, and farms, and gather treasures to grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR DRAGON</strong>: Choose your dragon\u2019s color, horns, and accessories, and pick your flame type to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE SKILLS</strong>: Enhance your abilities to fly faster, regenerate health, sense enemies from afar, and deal massive damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AND DEFEND YOUR LAIR</strong>: Transform your home into a fortress, adding defenses to protect it from knights and rival creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC BATTLES</strong>: Confront knights, evade catapults, and fight fearsome dragon bosses for dominance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER TREASURES</strong>: Attack villages and castles to collect food, gold, and jewels that fuel your evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soar through the skies, crush your enemies, and claim your rightful place as the ruler of Dragon Realms!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Be the Dragon. Rule the World.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dragon Realms, you take control of a powerful dragon on a mission to dominate a vast fantasy world. Fly across sprawling lands, destroy villages, castles, and farms, and gather treasures to grow even stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR DRAGON</strong>: Choose your dragon\u2019s color, horns, and accessories, and pick your flame type to unleash devastating attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE SKILLS</strong>: Enhance your abilities to fly faster, regenerate health, sense enemies from afar, and deal massive damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD AND DEFEND YOUR LAIR</strong>: Transform your home into a fortress, adding defenses to protect it from knights and rival creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPIC BATTLES</strong>: Confront knights, evade catapults, and fight fearsome dragon bosses for dominance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GATHER TREASURES</strong>: Attack villages and castles to collect food, gold, and jewels that fuel your evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soar through the skies, crush your enemies, and claim your rightful place as the ruler of Dragon Realms!</i></p>",
